# NativMix Critical Gotchas

## PyQt signal wiring
- Every signal needs both `.emit()` and `.connect()`.
- `QPushButton.clicked` slots must accept `checked: bool = False`.
- Use `@_slot_guard` for all GUI slots.

## IPC and race safety
- Never call `shutdown(SHUT_WR)` in `QLocalSocket` client code.
- In `_on_new_connection`, check `bytesAvailable()` before waiting on `readyRead`.

## Audio and GUI consistency
- Keep fallback chain for audio names:
  `application.name` -> `binary` -> `media.name` -> `"Unknown"`.
- For editable `QComboBox`, debounce `editTextChanged` with `QTimer.singleShot(500)`.
- Save and emit only in the timer timeout slot to avoid reconnect storms.

## Config ownership
- Each config setter changes only its own field.
- Do not create side effects across config fields.
- GUI is the only owner of its own flags.
